                                Perhaps most importantly, I gained a deeper understanding of the logistics required to
                                operate a robust online business efficiently. These lessons, though hard-earned, have
                                been instrumental in shaping my approach to subsequent entrepreneurial endeavors.
                            </h5>

                        </div>
                        <!--/Text Wrapper-->

                    </div>
                    <!--/Column-->

                </div>
                <!--/Wrapper-->

